From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BananaDS <bananads@localhost>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 92/94] LAN: the host only waits for MP replies from players in
 its DS group

The host waited for replies from every player connected to the LAN session, so a player that is connected but
not in the game's group (its menu open, between races) stalled every MP frame. Players count as active once
they answer, drop out after 20 missed replies, and frames that arrive early are requeued and restamped
instead of dropped. Also learns our own MAC from the traffic (MyMAC).
---
 src/net/LAN.cpp | 154 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 src/net/LAN.h   |  12 ++++
 2 files changed, 160 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/net/LAN.cpp b/src/net/LAN.cpp
